# ===========================================
# FiscalZen Docker Ignore
# ===========================================

# Dependencies (installed fresh in Docker)
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build outputs
**/dist
**/build
**/.next

# Development files
**/.turbo
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env*.local

# IDE
.idea
.vscode
*.swp
*.swo

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Test & Coverage
coverage
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts

# Documentation (not needed in production image)
*.md
!README.md
docs

# Certificates (should be mounted as volumes)
certs

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
